 e event in Indiana for line dancers\, couples\, dance teams and choreogra
 phers holding dance workshops and dance competitions all weekend. Beginne
 r to Advanced dancers welcome. Over 150 Workshops. Seven workshops to cho
 ose from each hour. Line\, Pattern Partner\, Couples (West Coast Swing\, 
 East Coast Swing\, Hustle\, Country Two Step\, Country Swing\, Night Club
  2-Step\, Cha Cha\, Dance Technique\, Presentation and Style workshops) a
 nd NTA Instructor workshops. All workshops are included in your pass (NO 
