BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:e28a1ef23d2318fc5f2d9635@visitsouthbend.com
DTSTAMP:20260825T080852Z
SUMMARY:RITUAL BREAKS (EX-MUTEMATH MEMBERS) WSG SUCRÉ AND DEEP AL BRINDLE
LOCATION:Stockroom East | 625 E Jefferson Blvd | South Bend\, IN 46617
DESCRIPTION:Ritual Breaks is an indie-electronic\, dance-rock outfit consis
 ting of former MUTEMATH bandmates Darren King and Roy Mitchell-Cárdenas 
 and multi-instrumentalist Cory Hale. Inspired by a sonic spectrum of 70s 
 soul\, Afrobeat and analog synth-pop\, King and Hale began Ritual Breaks 
 in 2025 as an experimental/instrumental collaboration. As the duo began i
 ncorporating vocal elements into their project\, they enlisted Mitchell-C
 árdenas to contribute guitar and bass parts as well. Soon later\, he off
 icially joined the band. Ritual Breaks plans to release new music through
 out the rest of 2026\, culminating with a full-length album in the Fall.\
 n\nSupporting is indie-pop band Sucré\, formed by Eisley co-founder/voca
 list Stacy King and her producer husband Darren\, and LA-based\, fashion-
 forward\, electronic-pop duo Deep AL Brindle.\n\nMore Info: https://www.v
 isitsouthbend.com/events/ritual-breaks-ex-mutemath-members-wsg-sucr%C3%A9
 -and-deep-al-brindle/
URL:https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/ritual-breaks-ex-mutemath-members
 -wsg-sucr%C3%A9-and-deep-al-brindle/
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260827T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260827T223000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:cb4e8a8bdc7744281488018f@visitsouthbend.com
DTSTAMP:20260825T080852Z
SUMMARY:SECOND HAND NEWS: FLEETWOOD MAC TRIBUTE
LOCATION:Stockroom East | 625 E Jefferson Blvd | South Bend\, IN 46617
DESCRIPTION:Second Hand News recreates the experience of seeing Fleetwood M
 ac in their heyday.\n\nMade up of veteran Chicago musicians (Melissa Brau
 sch\, Josh Chicoine\, Mike Holtz\, Dan Ingenthron\, Mike Vanier\, and Lin
 dsay Weinberg)\, the band features spot-on vocal harmonies\, careful atte
 ntion to detail\, and electric live shows. Through the talents of these s
 easoned performers\, the spirit and musicianship of Fleetwood Mac come to
  life on stage.\n\nAudiences are energized by dynamic deliveries of favor
 ites from the band's extensive catalog of hits as well as deep cuts belov
 ed by superfans. The fun these musicians have recreating these classic so
 ngs together is infectious\, and will bring you to your feet in shared ap
 preciation for one of the greatest bands of all time.\n\nMore Info: https
 ://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/second-hand-news-fleetwood-mac-tribute/
URL:https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/second-hand-news-fleetwood-mac-tr
 ibute/
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260828T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260828T223000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
