DTSTAMP:20260825T080852Z
SUMMARY:SOUL FOOD LUNCHEON
LOCATION:Charles Martin Youth Center | 802 Lincolnway West | South Bend\, I
 N 46616
DESCRIPTION:🥘 South Bend Heritage Soul Food Luncheon\n\nFriday\, June 27
 \, 2025 | 11:30 AM – 1:00 PM\n\n📍 Charles Martin Youth Center – 80
 2 Lincolnway West\, South Bend\, IN\n\nJoin us for an afternoon of cultur
 e\, connection\, and community at the South Bend Heritage Soul Food Lunch
 eon—a vibrant celebration of legacy\, love\, and local impact. This ann
 ual gathering brings together neighbors\, leaders\, and changemakers over
  a shared meal rooted in tradition and soul.\n\nEnjoy delicious food\, po
 werful stories\, and uplifting fellowship\, all while supporting the work
  of South Bend Heritage in affordable housing\, neighborhood revitalizati
 on\, and community engagement.\n\n🎟️ Tickets: $35\n\nLet’s honor o
 ur history and feed the future—one plate at a time.\n\nMore Info: https
 ://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/soul-food-luncheon/
URL:https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/soul-food-luncheon/
