BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:a7d606ff56133a85d8edfa8b@visitsouthbend.com
DTSTAMP:20260825T080852Z
SUMMARY:THE CHRISTOPHERS (2025)
LOCATION:DeBartolo Performing Arts Center\, 100 Performing Arts Center | No
 tre Dame\, 46556
DESCRIPTION:Select a DateBrowning Cinema New at the Browning Directed by St
 even Soderbergh With Ian McKellen\, Michaela Coel\, James Corden Rated R\
 , 100 minutes\, DCP Steven Soderbergh and Ian McKellen\, two guys with zi
 llions of credits to their filmographies\, team up with the brilliant but
  lesser seen Miachaela Coel (I May Destroy You\, Chewing Gum) in this liv
 ely black comedy. A mainstay of the London art scene since his starry bre
 akout in the creative explosion of the 1960's\, Julian Sklar (McKellen) h
 as drifted into a cluttered\, self-imposed seclusion. His two estranged c
 hildren (James Corden\, Jessica Gunning) enlist Lori (Coel) \, a young pa
 inter and sometime-forger\, to pose as a prospective assistant and gain a
 ccess to a fabled series of unfinished canvases Julian has buried deep in
  his home studio\, in a deceptive bid to secure an inheritance for themse
